      "height": 246.4,
      "rotation": 0,
      "opacity": 1,
      "textRegions": [
       {
        "characters": "・有心臟病、高血壓、糖尿病、癲癇、氣喘、肺部疾病、耳鼻喉問題、\n    近期動過手術或懷孕，不建議潛水，或需先經醫師評估。\n ",
        "formatting": {
         "fontSize": 21,
         "fontWeight": "normal",
         "color": "#ffffff",
         "textAlign": "start",
         "lineHeight": 1.8,
         "letterSpacing": 0,
         "decoration": "none"
        }
       },
       {
        "characters": "   報名時會請你填 PADI 健康問卷。",
        "formatting": {
         "fontSize": 21,
         "fontWeight": "normal",
         "color": "#edc40f",
         "textAlign": "start",
         "lineHeight": 1.8,
         "letterSpacing": 0,
         "decoration": "none"
        }
       },
       {
        "characters": "\n・潛水後至少間隔 12–18 小時再搭飛機。\n・潛水前 8–12 小時不喝酒；前一晚睡飽，感冒鼻塞請改期。\n・天候或海況不佳時，教練會以安全為優先調整或取消，\n    退款方式請見〈退款與停航政策〉。",
        "formatting": {
         "fontSize": 21,
         "fontWeight": "normal",
         "color": "#ffffff",
         "textAlign": "start",
